OpenCollar documentation hub: licensing overview
================================================

This repository contains documentation, data files and small build scripts
that are licensed under different but compatible open licenses.

Unless otherwise noted in a specific file or directory:

- Documentation and data (everything under docs/ and data/, README.md,
  DISCOVERY-REPORT.md and the site built from them) is licensed under the
  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License
  (CC-BY-SA-4.0). See LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

- Scripts, configuration and workflows (scripts/, main.py, mkdocs.yml,
  .github/) are licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSES/MIT.txt.

The hardware, firmware and tools that this site documents live in their own
repositories under their own licenses.

